@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Local transaction versus external consistency
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

rectangle "Bounded local transaction" {
 rectangle "Current guard / identity binding" as G
 database "Owned state + durable intent / attempt" as D
 G --> D : coherent local commit
}
component "Dispatch / worker\ncurrent authority + claim" as W
cloud "External effect boundary" as E
database "Attributable observations" as O
D --> W : committed intent
W --> E : actual eligible dispatch
E --> O : observed evidence, possibly absent / partial
W --> O : guarded local recording
note bottom of E
 Not part of SQL atomic rollback.
 Local fencing does not terminate an old remote action.
end note

@enduml
